<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10061" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντῐκρῠς</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>straight on, right on,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντικρυς ἰὼν παρεκαθέζετο ἐκ
			δεξιᾶς</span> he came <i>straight up</i> and . ., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Euthd.</u>
				273b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1068
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.4
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ ἀ. πορεύεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					223b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>outright, openly, without disguise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως ἄ. τάδ᾽ αἰνέσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					192
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ χρησμὸς ἄ. λέγει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					128
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔχονταί γε πλουτεῖν ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					134
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἔφη χρῆναι πλεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.49
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἃ ἠδικοῦντο οὐ δηλοῦντες ἄντικρυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.30
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν ἢ ἄ. δουλείαν</span>
			<i>downright</i> slavery, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.122
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἄ. ἐλευθερία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.64
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἄ.</span> not <i>at all,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ διοίσοντ᾽ ἄ. τῶν Ἡρακλειδῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					384
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> sts. of Time,
				<i>straightway,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συλλαβόντες ἄγουσιν ἄ. ὡς
					ἀποκτενοῦντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					13.78
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax</u>
				367a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικρύ</span>
			, <i>opposite,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. εῖναι</span> to <i>oppose,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1243a37
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. ἐπιέναι</span>”
				<i>against,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					3.24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταστῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Sol.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακλιθῆναί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>3 Ma.</u>
					5.16
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ ἄ. πυαλίδι</span>
			<u>CIG</u> (add.)<i><span class="en">
				4224e
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Cragus</span>): c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. Χίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Act.Ap.</u>
					20.15
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				395.4
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc.—Gramm. distinguish
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικρύ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἐναντίας</span>
			, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄντικρυς,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φανερῶς, διαρρήδην</span>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				408
			</span></i>, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντικρύ</span> (q.v.) has
			both senses in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κρυ</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς</span>) prob. akin to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρας,
			κάρα.</span>)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
